    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2028502710929203495",
      "url": "https://x.com/CYBTRAFFIC/status/2028502710929203495",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CYBTRAFFIC/status/2028502710929203495",
      "text": "🚨 PUBLIC NOTICE – HOLI FESTIVAL 2026 | TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚨\nAs per orders issued by the Cyberabad Police Commissionerate:\n\n🔹 Wine/Toddy Shops and Bars (except Star Hotels & Registered Clubs) will remain closed from 06:00 AM to 06:00 PM on 03-03-2026.\n\n🔹 The following are prohibited from 1800 hrs on 02-03-2026 to 0600 hrs on 04-03-2026:\n• Throwing colours/coloured water on unwilling persons, vehicles, or in public places.\n• Movement of two-wheelers and other vehicles in groups causing disturbance, inconvenience, or danger to the public.\n\n🚦 Traffic Advisory:\n• Do not ride in groups or perform stunts on public roads.\n• Avoid rash driving, overspeeding, and triple riding.\n• Strict action against Drunk & Drive violations.\n• Follow helmet and seatbelt rules without exception.\n• Cooperate with traffic personnel and follow diversions, if any.\n\n⚠️ Violators will face strict legal action as per law.\nLet’s celebrate Holi with joy, safety, and responsibility.\n\n#CyberabadPolice #CyberabadTrafficPolice #Holi2026 #TrafficAdvisory #RoadSafety #NoDrunkDriving #CelebrateResponsibly #SafeHoli",
